    "body": "Cannot start #3015 within its scope on upstream/main d911f45535df24c42d5fde5feaed386c5fca4907.\n\nThe required work in #3011, #3012, and #3013 is not available on main.\nThe CL transform module is absent. PatternDef and the pattern folder commands are absent.\nIssue #3011 has a claim. Issues #3012 and #3013 remain open.\nNo open PR provides these prerequisites for a stack.\n\nCircular copies need the folder expansion and verification paths from those issues.\nImplementing those paths here would exceed the assigned scope of #3015.\nStopped before the claim. No source changes or tests were made.\n",
